<title>SWEDEN: Foreningsbanken sees better 1997.</title>
<headline>Foreningsbanken sees better 1997.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Foreningsbanken on Tuesday posted a 14 percent rise in 1996 profits, saying it expected continuing improvement in its performance in 1997.</p>
<p>Foreningsbanken said earlier it planned to merge with the larger Swedish bank Swedbank</p>
